{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "21233c1faf4da3967543354d55535d313ef08e84584ff23be35831600e872948", "ja": "（ひなたのライブが、無事終わった。\n大人も童心にかえるような、いいステージだったな）", "zh": "（日向的演唱会顺利结束了。\n是一场连大人都能恢复童心的出色表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "4cdca13527c6aa5b1af56d511e6dc3a810cdde81e1e42945c6037f9176c771dc", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさんでした。\n今日のライブ、どうだったかねえ？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n今天的演唱会如何呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c7db568d6ae4484e9ab3b177e24e9b6ba1ad44f0e6dce4c424bb9db29753b433", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。いいライブだったんじゃないか？\n客席が、みんな笑顔だったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。\n我觉得你表现很不错，让观众席充满了笑容喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "c1b05e6004f77ee05fb0ac335e00a0c5660bef563d45120cd5cf64de7d9a1b1b", "ja": "わぁ……本当かい？\nそれなら、あたしもうれしいよぉ。", "zh": "哇……真的吗？\n这样的话，我也很开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "f739f1eed2671fce6bd8d761af1e04de85ecf281cc9f73158aa41083170fa40d", "ja": "ステージの上からもね、客席がちゃあんと見えたんさ。\nお客さんたち、なんだかキラキラして見えたよぉ。", "zh": "在舞台上，可以很清楚地看见观众席哪。\n观众们看起来都好耀眼喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ae1d606e95776dc8f054faf67ec4bff5d318efad54cb9d625ca08ce40a26fdc6", "ja": "そうか。きっとひなたの笑顔で、\nお客さんも笑顔になったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，那一定是因为大家看到日向的笑容后，\n也跟着笑起来了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "f44d1e28ca4c6cdde14974744ad2f18d6434476fee5a2a4f233b3c49472330a6", "ja": "えへへ、そうだといいなぁ。終わってしまうのが、\nなんだかもったいないけども……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，希望真的是这样～\n演唱会就这样结束了，我好舍不得哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "875cb95b5c4cc50a98c1403df6c3c304aecbea5f562f1f908ae4afe7eeb1a90d", "ja": "{$P$}は、まだ忙しいんでしょや？\nあたし、先に戻ってるねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}，你还要忙吧？\n那我先回去了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "62dfa30ea4cb98d96bbba4bac1f64f0988dfe391dc164ea5e94e561976ad6777", "ja": "あ、ひなた、ちょっと待ってくれ。青羽さんに、\nひなたに渡して欲しいって言われたものが……。", "zh": "啊，日向，先等一下。\n青羽小姐说有东西要给你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "520db8f32b1ddc95b2384d5c669c68aa4221fb3a5e1ff8e41916d5a6136e01f4", "ja": "え……美咲さんが、あたしにかい？\nなんだろうねえ？", "zh": "咦……美咲要给我东西吗？\n是什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9dbe0f80fdc980c71b53da1d0a78efcc00eb37ecee81dce663984303b04a201c", "ja": "あ、あったあった。\n……はい。ひなた宛のファンレターだ。", "zh": "啊，找到了。\n……来，这是给日向的粉丝信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "d6340fd6f9e022b1125e9e8f0485bc4e7af742e25e55825ae67cda9a617baa26", "ja": "わぁ、ありがたいねぇ！　なまらうれしいべさ。\nそれじゃ、さっそく読ませてもらおうかねぇ……。", "zh": "哇～谢谢～！我特开心哪。\n那么，我马上来看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "199b4e8c347e12962c16144322eea86ba9a4547a3a2fd441dd50b5894c6ecea0", "ja": "えっと……あっ！？　{$P$}、\nこれ、この前の子グマの飼育員さんからだよぉ！", "zh": "这是……啊！？{$P$}，\n是之前那只小熊的饲养员寄来的耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "801ba03115ea0b683514db024e53c6d671e5cce3ea9016a7d10357b12ea95358", "ja": "あの子グマの写真が入ってるべさ。\nえへへ、やっぱりめんこいねえ。", "zh": "还附了那只小熊的照片哪。\n嘿嘿，真的好可爱喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5adbb85027d86c37262706100662cc46c76da8b11175e14f41c5f32ebe74a936", "ja": "よかったな、ひなた。", "zh": "那真是太好了，日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "9d1e19a4fcf2b882b24f8c61713255a507df9a6bf7d4dc2c87c5a9fa1c6b6776", "ja": "うん！　えへへ、元気そうだねぇ。\nちょっこし、おっきくなったかなぁ？　ふふっ。", "zh": "嗯！嘿嘿，小熊看起来很有精神哪～\n是不是长大了一点呢～？呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "97b9bdbb5f5ebe7b015e4dc6543465ca319b1251418fb73b33a1ddac42e5f81d", "ja": "あたしも、負けてられないねぇ。\nあの子に笑われないよう、しっかり成長せねば……。", "zh": "我也不能输给牠～\n我得好好成长才行，不然会被牠取笑的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "29447ac43eee9d9a3614272b7788d0fb93a3b4102a402ecd23863baae7058750", "ja": "笑われたりしないよ。\nひなただって、ちゃんと成長してるじゃないか。", "zh": "牠不会笑你啦。\n因为日向也已经成长很多了，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "c7f0c5c9a057d05a5bc7c2d28616344e452e1699c568d8706d2bd1e4d3295b0a", "ja": "ええ？　そうかい？　あたしは背もちっちゃいし、\n体重も増えてないけども……。", "zh": "咦，有吗？\n但是我个子还是很矮，体重也没增加哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bc847990375400dd4b91228d610579cf13161c5a3c99859919fb6c7be26b8fef", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……アイドルとしての成長かな？\n今日のライブも、ちゃんとお客さんを楽しませてたし。", "zh": "不，我不是那个意思……我是指身为偶像的成长。\n像是今天的演唱会，观众就看得很开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "024f767c293566af6be6ba1f01fdaf775d4cc07cc4d7c022f05808ef811dc9d4", "ja": "え、えへへ……そうかい？\nだったら、うれしいなぁ……。", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿……是吗？\n这样的话，我好开心哪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "3fe8e8d9d5cccccda717694d9730423ea902c741b0f3dfe0765288b32a2e5896", "ja": "あたし、あの子グマみたいに、見た人がほっこりできる\nライブにできたらなぁって、思ってたんだわ。", "zh": "其实我原本就希望这次演唱会能像那只小熊一样，\n让看到的人都能觉得心里暖暖的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "aab1713e58fa75d708cb8417847b9c645a4c35f26b287014af42ab89da0d452d", "ja": "{$P$}。あたし、また、\nあの子に会いにいきたいなぁ。いいだろか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我好想再去看看那只小熊喔～可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "443f2e9aca2c8b8f37cbce28ba323e42d3e87b96978404643274079652256935", "ja": "もちろん、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "当然可以，这主意不错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0084_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "e72809e9a04354b944911c93bb97ec24820dfbbb4f2499eb293e41b1cbd8d0a4", "ja": "うん！　あたしが、ちゃあんと大きくなったら……\n大きくなったあの子に、会いにいくねぇ！", "zh": "嗯！等我成长更多之后……\n要再去见长大的小熊一面～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
